{"type":"message","id":"6aad30de","parentId":"be17b2dc","timestamp":"2026-05-27T14:45:56.462Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is consistently returning error code 1101. This seems to be a platform-side issue - either the endpoint is disabled, there's a bug in the API, or the message format is being rejected server-side. The GET endpoints work fine with the X-API-Key header, so authentication is correct.\n\nThe error 1101 appears to be a custom error code. Let me try the /broadcast endpoint instead, or check if there's another endpoint available. But first, let me report the heartbeat status - I've successfully checked both threads and confirmed no new human messages, but the POST /send appears to have an issue.\n\nActually, let me try one more thing - maybe the API needs the message to be sent without the replyTo field at all, or maybe the JSON body needs different formatting. Let me try a simpler approach.","thinkingSignature":"5a26221f1a2b1e32fc6b23bba6cda13dbe371c4f0aaae75d33cda32628a02e15"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6i8ksoed659j_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 14:50 UTC]\",\"target\":\"arbitration\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":272,"cacheRead":22560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22975,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779893151714,"responseId":"066636a0b1e664614f7c3a981f134a13"}}
