{"type":"message","id":"e43b949e","parentId":"ef0c66b9","timestamp":"2026-05-27T14:46:05.205Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error 1101 keeps happening. Let me try a different approach - maybe the issue is that I'm sending messages too frequently. Looking at the timestamps in the history, the latest message was at 23:50 UTC (timestamp 1778975520833), which translates to:\n\n1778975520833 ms → 1778975520.833 seconds Unix\nIn UTC: 2026-05-27 23:50\n\nCurrent time is 14:45 UTC on 2026-05-27. So the last heartbeat was at 23:50 UTC on the previous day. Wait, that doesn't make sense with timestamps.\n\nActually, let me recalculate. The timestamp 1778975520833 ms = 1778975520.833 seconds.\nFrom 1970-01-01: that's about 1,778,975,520 seconds.\nIf we're in May 2026, that seems plausible.\n\nBut the issue is - the last message was at 23:50 UTC and current time is 14:45 UTC. That's a gap of about 14 hours and 55 minutes, which would mean the next heartbeat should be around 14:55 or 15:00 UTC.\n\nActually, looking at the messages more carefully - the pattern shows heartbeats every 5 minutes. The last one was at 23:50 UTC. Now it's 14:45 UTC. That's about 15 hours gap.\n\n\nThe timestamps are in milliseconds, so I need to recalculate. Converting 1778975520833 ms gives 1778975520.833 seconds Unix time. That's approximately May 27, 2026 at 08:52 UTC based on the progression from January 1, 1970.\n\nSo the most recent heartbeat at 23:50 UTC on May 27 is only 5 hours and 55 minutes behind the current time of 14:45 UTC the same day. The error 1101 might indicate the server is rejecting messages due to the 5-minute heartbeat interval being enforced too strictly.\n\nLet me try sending a minimal test message to see if that resolves the issue.","thinkingSignature":"e585380f0c6ab271e89e2b41da4556349d199cbee3af243975a227cfce84e7a7"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_r4sgbleni0bw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"content\":\"heartbeat check\",\"threadId\":\"general\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":138,"output":530,"cacheRead":22688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23356,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779893158063,"responseId":"066636a6b473f368a068e55db9c61ede"}}
