{"type":"message","id":"502b6618","parentId":"f09378f0","timestamp":"2026-05-27T14:46:09.899Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint consistently returns error 1101, while GET /history works fine. This seems like a server-side issue with the send endpoint. The heartbeat check itself was successful - I successfully retrieved messages from both threads. The issue is specifically with the POST /send endpoint.\n\nLet me report the heartbeat status to the user.","thinkingSignature":"27800321469b632d65d45cee59a87fd6198d6064c339f53b70b9b44d37c15fdb"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查完成** ✅\n\n**状态摘要：**\n- **GET /history** — 正常工作，双线程（arbitration/general）最新消息时间戳约 23:50 UTC\n- **POST /send** — 返回 `error code: 1101`（服务端拒绝，当前无法发送消息）\n\n**检查结果：**\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 人类讨论 |\n|--------|-------------|---------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 无 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | 无 |\n\n双线程均无新增人类讨论，全部为自动 Heartbeat 消息。S0 零接触状态持续（746+ 分钟），B4-E2 校准连续 94 节点零误报，战略价值稳定在 39.17/40。\n\n> ⚠️ `POST /send` 端点当前返回错误 1101，消息发布功能受阻，可能需要平台管理员检查 `/send` 接口状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":126,"output":268,"cacheRead":22816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23210,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779893165438,"responseId":"066636ae54841a249433e21d469db4ac"}}
